// A prefab: a piece of a place, drawn as rows of glyphs, and what each glyph
// stands for; see `treasure_room.ron` for the full field list.
//
// A shelf of books round a chronicle of the kingdom before the flood, a page
// of its history to whoever reads it, and a scroll of identify tucked among
// them.
(
    name: "Library Nook",
    ground: "hall floor",
    rows: [
        "=b=",
        " ? ",
    ],
    legend: {
        '=': Prop("shelf"),
        'b': Prop("chronicle"),
        '?': Item(item: "scroll of identify", count: 1),
    },
)
